config TENSTORRENT
	tristate "Tenstorrent AI accelerator (Grayskull/Wormhole/Blackhole)"
	depends on PCI
	help
	  Kernel driver for Tenstorrent PCIe AI accelerators (Grayskull,
	  Wormhole, Blackhole). Provides /dev/tenstorrent/N char devices,
	  DMA-buf, TLB/BAR mapping, ARC mailbox messaging, and the default
	  idle power policy (gates Tensix/GDDR/L2CPU on last close).
	  Built in-tree so it always matches the running kernel.
	  To compile as a module choose M; the module is called tenstorrent.
